        "continued_by": [
          "voxel-guidance-005"
        ]
      },
      "result_summary": "The compact representation was 64.27% smaller than deterministic prose and 17.22% smaller than canonical JSON. JSON and compact decoding both retained exact numerical equality across all 12 snapshots. The reference behavioral classifier remained the previously measured 10/12 a…",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/yurei-so/research/blob/main/experiments/voxel-guidance/docs/labnotes/voxel-guidance-004-machine-native-state-encoding.md"
    },
    {
